  * (26.1) the orthogonal decomposition `z = t u + w`, `w ⊥ u`, along which
    `f_N(z) = H_c(t - 1) + (1/2)‖w‖²`;
  * (26.2) the unique minimiser `z* = u`, `f_N* = 0`, `‖z*‖ = 1`;
